MODULE: TriggerNotLostTriggerOverwritten
TARGET: TriggerNotLost
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: Finishing an older sweep overwrites the queued on-demand trigger.
PERTURBS: Finish
--- FIND
    /\ demand' = IF servingDemand THEN "served" ELSE demand
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: discard the queued acknowledgement obligation.
    /\ demand' = "new"
--- END
